ickly.\n- Footstep sounds now become louder when moving quickly.\n- Added a new setting that allows the feature that clenches the player's hands when hitting a pose to be turned off.\n- The friend list in the Phone is now ordered alphabetically.\n\nFIXES:\n- Attempting a \"host steal\" will no longer work, nor result in the game freezing.\n- Setting your Quest's system language to Turkish will no longer disable your controllers.\n- A player's fists will no longer get stuck in a closed state after getting picked up by a pedestal.\n- Matchmaking as a party should no longer take more time than expected.\n- The Dressing Room's curtains will no longer randomly be offset from their regular positions.", "created_date": 1789131668, "id": "28527715146865994", "version": "0.5.1.5", "version_code": 47, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28527699393534236"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24375141285456755", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28611537981817043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789126568, "id": "28526753483628827", "version": "0.5.1.5", "version_code": 46, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28526748406962668"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24375141285456755", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28611537981817043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788992488, "id": "28505036592467183", "version": "0.5.1.5", "version_code": 45, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28505033599134149"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24375141285456755", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28611537981817043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1079468633829966"}]}, "change_log": "CHANGES:\n- Adjusted Structure motion SFX settings to be more present during gameplay.\n- Added SFX to the Park's waterfalls.\n- Updated the background environment textures across all scenes.\n\nFIXES:\n- Audio playing during scene switches has been fixed.\n- Reverted the increased height at which you could target structures.\n- Improved Gear Market button responsiveness.\n- Added collision to the Party Board.\n- Fixed the Matchmaker ToolTip not turning off when ToolTips are turned off.\n- Shiftstone Quickswapper rocks no longer fly off.\n- Fixed a bug that would allow you to play Host for a second time after a rematch.\n- (probably) Fixed a bug where you'd get stuck when joining a Park with 3 players.", "created_date": 1788783471, "id": "28472860672351442", "version": "0.5.1.4", "version_code": 44, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28472856045685238"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}